{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13207070","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13207070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1320707001:1":{"text":"アイスベリーの砂糖漬けはありますか？","source_cn":"有没有冰晶莓做的果脯？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB734E3C52837F05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320707002:1":{"text":"もちろん！うちのは自分で栽培しているアイスベリーだから、野生のよりも大きくて甘いわよ！","source_cn":"你找对人了！我家都是自己种的冰晶莓，比野外采摘的那些个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D1C713814DC54E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320707003:0":{"text":"炭も上等なのを使ってるから、干し上がった果肉はもっちりと歯ごたえが良くて、独特な香りがするの！","source_cn":"我家烘干果脯用的上好煤炭，烘出来的果肉不仅口感弹软，还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A89851C70357A04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320707004:0":{"text":"どれどれ……","source_cn":"我尝尝……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51A5F5F9A56038F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320707005:0":{"text":"んん！美味しいです！これはいくらですか？","source_cn":"嗯！真不错，怎么卖？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF077A78C039760C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320707006:0":{"text":"こちらがお値段よ。","source_cn":"这个数。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x124F05EDA40E50F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320707007:0":{"text":"さ、三千！？少し高くないですか？","source_cn":"三……三千！是不是贵了点？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32F16B0DB9DAD509","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320707008:0":{"text":"お兄さんはここの人じゃないみたいだけど、安かろう悪かろうって言葉、知ってる？","source_cn":"小哥，我看你这模样不是本地人，你知道一分钱一分货的道理吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAB02884A0A1FD61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320707009:0":{"text":"知ってますけど……他にも色々買いたいし……","source_cn":"知道是知道……可我还想留些钱买点别的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD98FF84A93D7FA33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1320707009":{"text":"知ってますけど……他にも色々買いたいし……","source_cn":"知道是知道……可我还想留些钱买点别的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD98FF84A93D7FA33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320707010:1":{"text":"どうぞ他のお店のも食べてみるといいわ。そうすれば、うちが一番だって分かるから。","source_cn":"你们先去别家尝尝看嘛，尝了就知道还是我家的最好吃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D